+/******************************************************************************
+ **
+ **  gckKERNEL_UnmapMemory
+ **
+ **  Unmap video memory from the current process space.
+ **
+ **  INPUT:
+ **
+ **      gckKERNEL Kernel
+ **          Pointer to an gckKERNEL object.
+ **
+ **      gctPHYS_ADDR Physical
+ **          Physical address of video memory to map.
+ **
+ **      gctSIZE_T Bytes
+ **          Number of bytes to map.
+ **
+ **      gctPOINTER Logical
